            {s.list ? <ul class="tick">{s.list.map(x => <li>{x}</li>)}</ul> : null}
            {s.paras ? s.paras.map(([k, v]) => <p><b>{k}</b> <span set:html={v} /></p>) : null}
            {s.outro ? <p>{s.outro}</p> : null}
            {s.more ? <p class="more" set:html={s.more} /> : null}
          </div></li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <p class="kick">What we offer</p>
      <h2>Dedicated Fertility Assessment and Diagnostic Services</h2>
      <p>Kamran Fertility Clinic provides different assessment pathways for specific reproductive concerns. Each pathway focuses on the clinical questions relevant to that patient.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        {services.map(([h, i, p, l1, t1, l2, t2]) => (
          <div class="card svc"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={icons[i]} /></span><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p><p class="more"><a href={l1}>{t1} →</a>{l2 ? <> <br /><a href={l2}>{t2} →</a></> : null}</p></div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="concerns">
      <p class="kick">Common concerns</p>
      <h2>Common Fertility Concerns Evaluated During Consultation</h2>
      <p>Fertility problems can have different causes, and more than one factor may contribute to difficulty conceiving. The assessment process considers the patient's symptoms, medical history and previous investigations before deciding what needs further attention.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        {concerns.map(([h, p, more]) => <div class="card svc"><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p><p class="more" set:html={more} /></div>)}
      </div>
      <h3 class="sh">Lifestyle and age: what the assessment also looks at</h3>
      <p>Smoking, alcohol, body weight, heat exposure and certain medicines or supplements can affect sperm quality and ovulation. Dr. Kamran reviews these with you and advises on practical changes, including whether folic acid before conception is appropriate for the female partner. Female age is also discussed openly, because it affects both timing and the options available.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="pathways">
      <p class="kick">After the assessment</p>
      <h2>Connecting Fertility Assessment to Tailored Treatment Pathways</h2>
      <p>Diagnostic evaluation at Kamran Fertility Clinic provides the information needed to discuss appropriate treatment options. Not every couple requires assisted reproductive treatment, and recommendations depend on the findings of the assessment. Depending on the clinical situation, possible pathways may include:</p>
      <div class="cards">
        {pathways.map(([h, p, l, t]) => <a class="card link" href={l}><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p><p class="more2">Learn about {t} →</p></a>)}
      </div>
      <p>The purpose of fertility assessment is to understand the clinical situation before deciding whether treatment, further investigation or continued natural conception is appropriate. Browse all <a href={TR}>fertility treatments</a> or request a <a href="/services/support">second opinion</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="bring">
      <p class="kick">Prepare</p>
      <h2>What to Bring to Your First Fertility Consultation</h2>
      <p>Preparing for your fertility consultation can make it easier for the doctor to understand your history and avoid repeating investigations unnecessarily. If available, bring:</p>
      <ul class="tick two">{bring.map(b => <li>{b}</li>)}</ul>
      <p>Both partners should bring their previous fertility records if possible. If you do not have previous reports, you can still attend the consultation and discuss your concerns.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="fees">
      <p class="kick">Logistics</p>
      <h2>Consultation Logistics, Fee Transparency and Clinic Locations</h2>
      <p>Fertility consultations with Dr. Kamran Saleem are available at three practice locations in Lahore. Patients can contact the clinic to discuss the available appointment schedule and select a convenient location.</p>
      <div class="cards c3x">
        {locations.map(([n, ad, h, l]) => <a class="card link" href={l}><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={icons.pin} /></span><h3>{n}</h3><p>{ad}</p><p class="hrs2">{h}</p><p class="more2">Clinic page →</p></a>)}
      </div>
      <div class="split">
        <div class="card"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={icons.tag} /></span><h3>Initial consultation fee</h3>
          <p>{consultFee ? `The initial consultation fee is ${consultFee}. ` : ""}Please contact the clinic to confirm the current consultation fee and any separate investigation costs before booking.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={icons.check} /></span><h3>Personalised investigations</h3>
          <p>Tests are recommended according to clinical history, symptoms and examination findings. Not every patient requires the same diagnostic panel. Examples of individual tests: <a href={`${TS}/semen-analysis`}>semen analysis</a>, <a href={`${TS}/male-fertility-hormone-test`}>male hormone test</a>, <a href={`${TS}/female-fertility-hormone-test`}>female hormone test</a>.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p><b>Appointment booking:</b> contact the clinic by phone or WhatsApp at <a href="tel:+923148432789">{phone}</a> to ask about male fertility consultations, female fertility consultations or a couple fertility assessment. See <a href="/locations">all locations</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="faq">
      <p class="kick">Questions</p>
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Fertility Assessment and Consultation</h2>
      {faqs.map(([q, ans]) => <details><summary>{q}</summary><p set:html={ans} /></details>)}
      <div class="urdu" lang="ur" dir="rtl">
        <h3>خلاصہ (اردو)</h3>
        <p>لاہور میں فرٹیلیٹی اسیسمنٹ اور مشاورت: اگر شادی کو ایک سال ہو چکا ہو اور حمل نہ ٹھہر رہا ہو (یا خاتون کی عمر 35 سال یا اس سے زیادہ ہو تو چھ ماہ بعد)، تو میاں بیوی دونوں کا معائنہ کروانا چاہیے۔ ڈاکٹر کامران سلیم پہلی ملاقات میں دونوں کی میڈیکل ہسٹری اور پرانی رپورٹس کا جائزہ لیتے ہیں اور صرف ضروری ٹیسٹ تجویز کرتے ہیں۔ ملاقات کے لیے واٹس ایپ کریں: <span dir="ltr">+92 314 8432789</span></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="why">
      <p class="kick">Your doctor</p>
      <h2>Why Choose Dr. Kamran Saleem for Fertility Consultation in Lahore?</h2>
      <p>Choosing a fertility doctor is an important decision for couples experiencing difficulty conceiving. The assessment should provide an opportunity to discuss concerns openly, understand available medical information and make informed decisions without unnecessary pressure.</p>
      <p>Dr. Kamran Saleem completed his MBBS in 1988 and obtained a Diploma in Genito-Urinary Medicine and Venereology from the University of Liverpool, UK, in 1998. His clinical experience in reproductive health and fertility care informs his approach to male and female fertility concerns.</p>
      <h3 class="sh">At Kamran Fertility Clinic, the consultation approach focuses on:</h3>
      <ul class="tick two">
        <li>Listening carefully to both partners' medical and reproductive histories.</li>
        <li>Reviewing existing reports before recommending additional investigations.</li>
        <li>Explaining results and possible next steps in understandable language.</li>
        <li>Considering male and female fertility factors together.</li>
        <li>Discussing the benefits and limitations of available options.</li>
        <li>Recommending investigations according to individual clinical needs.</li>
        <li>Helping couples make informed decisions about their fertility care.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="/dr-kamran-saleem">About Dr. Kamran Saleem →</a> · <a href="/success-stories">Patient success stories →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section id="related">
